    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Renowned CBC News Network Host Heather Hiscox, will lead a fascinating panel discussion about the  four remarkable Canadian women who are the subjects of –Life Reflected—a groundbreaking world premiere on May 19, that celebrates the lives of four Canadian women — author Alice Munro, teen Amanda Todd, astronaut Roberta Bondar, and Mi’kmaw poet and elder Rita Joe — through music, film, photography, graphic design, and the written word. Life Reflected is the most ambitious creation project in National Arts Centre Orchestra’s history.\n\nWHAT:  Panel Discussion –..."
      }
